      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T00:10:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Is the intent to keep those fields\n\nMy intent is to make these fields unnecessary where possible.\n\n\u003e Or to replace them with the Segment chain\n\nThis is the intent, barring some yet-to-be-foreseen problem.\n\n\u003e If the latter, what is the USB hop address and how does EM derive it?\n\nI will rework the document to address your query.",
